meta {
  name: getEtimValues
  type: http
  seq: 4
}

post {
  url: https://{{customer}}.{{domain}}/jsonrpc
  body: json
  auth: inherit
}

body:json {
  {
    "jsonrpc": "2.0",
    "method": "getEtimValues",
    "params": {
      "etim_class_code": "EC002713",
      "etim_feature_code": "EF000006"
    },
    "id": 1
  }
}

docs {
  Retrieve ETIM values with optional translations. Filter by class and/or feature code to get only relevant values.

  | Parameter | Type | Required | Description |
  |---|---|---|---|
  | `page` | integer | no | Page number (1-based) |
  | `limit` | integer | no | Maximum number of results per page (1–2500) |
  | `etim_class_code` | string (nullable) | no | Filter to values valid for this ETIM class code (e.g. "EC000001") |
  | `etim_release` | string (nullable) | no | ETIM release to resolve the class version (e.g. "ETIM-9.0"); used with etim_class_code |
  | `etim_feature_code` | string (nullable) | no | Filter to values valid for this ETIM feature code (e.g. "EF000001"); A-type features only |
  | `search_query` | string (nullable) | no | Free-text search on value description or code |
  | `include_languages` | string[] (nullable) | no | Language codes to include translations for (e.g. ["nl", "en"]) |

  **Example: Values for feature EF000006**

  ```json
  {
    "jsonrpc": "2.0",
    "method": "getEtimValues",
    "params": {
      "etim_class_code": "EC002713",
      "etim_feature_code": "EF000006"
    },
    "id": 1
  }
  ```

  Result:

  ```json
  {
    "etim_values": [
      {
        "etim_value_code": "EV000001"
      },
      {
        "etim_value_code": "EV000002"
      },
      {
        "etim_value_code": "EV000003"
      }
    ],
    "page": {
      "number_of_items": 3,
      "items_per_page": 100,
      "number_of_pages": 1,
      "current_page": 1
    }
  }
  ```
}
